dertone. Right half — after treatment: luminous hydrated skin with natural inner glow, smooth refined texture with no visible fine lines, plump and supple surface catching soft specular highlights, translucent rosy-cream complexion with golden undertone, healthy dewy finish. \n\nThe transition at the center line is seamless — same woman, same facial structure, only skin quality differs. Subtle gradient blend zone at the division, no harsh cut.\n\nLighting: beauty photography setup — large soft key light at 45 degrees creating gentle shadows that reveal skin texture on the left (emphasizing dryness) while the right side catches a luminous wrap-around glow (emphasizing radiance). Soft fill from opposite side. Clean white reflector bounce under chin for even under-eye illumination. \n\nBackground: clean gradient from cool muted gray on the left to warm soft white on the right, reinforcing the before/after mood shift without distraction.\n\nStyle: high-end skincare commercial, editorial beauty photography, clinical yet aspirational, premium cosmetic advertisement aesthetic, 8K skin detail, no text, no watermark, no logo."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#6c6088", "size": [240, 200], "pos": [0, 886], "id": 41, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [41], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#3f384f", "widgets_values": ["", "3:4", false, 1373074978, "randomize", "2k"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 39, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "la